Z||000006||Fiero5||10-19-2000||01:47 PM||||At least the Fiero got chosen over some other car like a Yugo or something.<BR>OK, now some Yugo owner will flame me. Whenever something is mentioned, good or bad, it does give it exposure :o)<BR>It helps bring it to the forefront and into discussions where we with the proper knowledge can possibibly educate those who don't know.<P>I am sure we can all find an analogy of some item out there, that is or was viewed unjustly as a bad thing. The Fiero suffers alot from people who really don't know that much about them (if anything), but think they know enough only to help prejudice others with incorrect or partial information. They then become as ignorant as the one who fed them the  misinformation. <P>I think as the Fiero continues to age, it will continue it's resurgance as being recognized as a pretty affordable, very nice and almost endless modification friendly sports car.<P>Just my thoughts on the subject :o)<P>------------------<BR>                                                                                                <IMG SRC="http://www.thisisfun.com/fiero_images/garagez.jpg"> ||||reg||1
